content:
style: photorealistic, 35mm film look, ARRI ALEXA aesthetic, natural lighting, high dynamic range

@image1 = rider, secured in a saddle harness
@image2 = dragon, oversized but believable next to the rider

wide aerial shot over London at golden hour, dragon soaring past the Shard, London Eye and the Thames, camera tracking alongside as the rider's coat and hood react to wind physics

one continuous prompt through the descent and landing on Tower Bridge, claws gripping stone, no re-prompting between cuts
